TactileSim
Copyright 2026 SO-101 MuJoCo Tactile contributors.

The lumped tactile mechanics, sensor interface and Velostat readout originated
in TactileSim work by Ariel Slepyan, and were adapted and integrated by the
SO-101 MuJoCo Tactile contributors. OpenTac modifies their parameters,
validation and interfaces.

OpenTac-CAD (formerly OpenTactileCAD) defines the sensor manifest conventions used by the loader.
Packaged signal profiles retain their original calibration-source metadata.
